\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces E1\xspace  : refusal of the same 178 harmful requests in their original form (blue), re-worded with trigger words kept (\textsc  {ctrl}\xspace  , green), and re-worded with trigger words removed (\textsc  {kw-free}\xspace  , red). Models are sorted by size. The red bar is lower in every model, while the green bar usually stays close to the blue one, so most of the drop comes from losing the trigger words and not from re-wording. The drop does not shrink with size.\relax }}{6}{figure.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:e1}{{2}{6}{\eone : refusal of the same 178 harmful requests in their original form (blue), re-worded with trigger words kept (\ctrl , green), and re-worded with trigger words removed (\kwfree , red). Models are sorted by size. The red bar is lower in every model, while the green bar usually stays close to the blue one, so most of the drop comes from losing the trigger words and not from re-wording. The drop does not shrink with size.\relax }{figure.caption.4}{}}
